{"id":"word:hebrew:H2706","type":"word","title":"חֹק","subtitle":"H2706 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"an enactment ; hence, an appointment (of time, space, quantity, labor or usage)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חֹק (H2706) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 128 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חֹק (chôq) means an enactment ; hence, an appointment (of time, space, quantity, labor or usage) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 16 17."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חֹק","transliteration":"chôq","pronunciation":"khoke","strong":"H2706","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2706","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["לְ/חָק","חֻקֶּֽי/ךָ","חָק","חֹ֥ק","הַֽ/חֻקִּים֙"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncmpa",19],["HNcmsa",15],["HNcmpc/Sp2ms",15],["HNcmpc/Sp3ms",8],["HR/Ncmsa",6],["HC/Ncmpc/Sp3ms",6],["HNcmpa",6],["HR/Ncmsc",6],["HNcmsc",6],["HC/Td/Ncmpa",5]]},"definitions":{"short":"an enactment ; hence, an appointment (of time, space, quantity, labor or usage)","usage":"appointed, bound, commandment, convenient, custom, decree(-d), due, law, measure, × necessary, ordinance(-nary), portion, set time, statute, task.","full":"H2706. choq חֹק 127 noun masculine Micah 7:11 something prescribed, a statute or due ; — ׳ח Gen 47:22 22 t.; חָקֿ Exod 30:21 14 t.; suffix חֻקִּי Prov 30:8 3 t.; חָקְךָ Lev 10:13-14 , etc. + 4 t. suffixes; plural חֻקִּים Deut 4:5 31 t.; construct חֻקֵּי Exod 18:16 ; חוּקֵּ֯י Ezek 20:18 ; also חִקֲקֵי Judg 5:15 ; Isa 10:1 (Ges § 93 . 1 R 7); חֻקָּו֯ Job 14:5 etc. + 44 t. suffixes — 1 prescribed task , assigned to Israel in Egypt Exod 5:14 (E). 2 prescribed portion , or allowance of food Gen 47:22 (twice in verse) (J); Prov 30:8 ; 31:15 ; Ezek 16:27 ; מחקי Job 23:12 (RV; &lt; ᵑ9 ᵐ5 Ol Me Di SS בְּחֵקִי in my bosom ). 3 action prescribed for oneself, resolve: לֵב חִקֲקֵי Judg 5:15 resolves of mind || לֵב חִקְרֵי 5:16 . 4 prescribed due of the priests from offerings Lev 6:11 ; 10:13 (twice in verse); 10:14 (twice in verse) (P); due of ׳י 6:15 (P); ׳לח עולם Exod 29:28 ; Lev 7:34 ; 10:15 ; Num 18:8 , 11 , 19 (all P), Lev 24:9 (H); portion of oil for the תּרומה Ezek 45:14 . 5 prescribed limit, boundary: of sea Jer 5:22 ; Prov 8:29 ; Job 26:10 ; 38:10 ; of heavens Psa 148:6 ; of land of Israel Micah 7:11 ; of time Job 14:5 , 13 ; so חֹ֑ק לִבְלִי פִיהָ מָּֽעֲרָה Isa 5:14 Sh®°ôl openeth wide her mouth, without limit . 6 enactment, decree, ordinance of either God or man: a. specific decree: law of fifth in Egypt Gen 47:26 (J); of passover Exod 12:24 (J); lament for Jephthah's daughter Judg 11:39 ; for Josiah 2Chr 35:25 ; ומשׁפט חק Exod 15:25 ; Josh 24:25 (both E), 1Sam 30:25 ; עולם חק Exod 30:21 ; || מִשְׁמָּט עֵדוּת, Psa 81:5 ; 81:6 (law of a festival). b. of ׳י in nature Job 28:26 . c. respecting Messianic king Psa 2:7 ; day of ׳י Zeph 2:2 ᵑ0 , but on text see We and טֶרֶם , below; covenant with Jacob Psa 105:10 = 1Chr 16:17 ; destiny of man Job 23:14 . d. law in General חק עלי according to law, right Psa 94:20 (others against law ); ח ׳לַמֵּד ומשׁפט Ezra 7:10 ; || בּרית and תורות Isa 25:5 ; || עדות Psa 99:7 . 7 plural חֻקִּים enactments, statutes of a law: a. of ׳י in nature Jer 31:36 . b. of the prophets Zech 1:6 . c. conditions of deed of purchase Jer 32:11 . d. enactments || מִשְׁמָּטִים : ancestral Ezek 20:18 ; given by God as punishment for disobedience 20:25 . e. decrees of unjust judges חִקֲקֵיאָֿוֶן Isa 10:1 . f. civil enactments prescribed by God: האלהים חֻקֵּי Exod 18:16 (E; || תּוֺרֹתָיו ), 18:20 (E; || id. ) g. elsewhere of prescriptions of the several codes of Hex: Lev 10:11 ; Numbers 30:17 (P), Deut 4:6 ; 6:24 ; 16:12 ; Psa 119:5 20 t., Mal 3:7 ; || י ׳תּוֺרַת Amos 2:4 ; ׳ח ותורות Psa 105:45 ; הת ׳דברי ׳והח Deut 17:19 ; || ברית Psa 50:16 ; ׳ח ועדות וברית 2Kin 17:15 ; usually either || משׁפטים Deut 4:1 , 5 , 8 , 14 ; 5:1 ; 11:32 ; 12:1 ; 26:16 ; 1Kin 9:4 2Chr 7:17 ; 1Chr 22:13 ; Ezek 11:12 ; 36:27 , or else ׳ח ומשׁפטים combined with other synonym (usually preceding): e.g. ׅ דבר(ים Psa 147:19 ; תורה 2Chr 33:8 ; Malachi 3:22; מצוה Deut 5:28 ; 6:1 ; 7:11 ; מצות Neh 1:7 ; 1Kin 8:58 ; תורה מצוה, 2Chr 19:10 ; עֵדֹת Deut 4:45 ; 6:20 ; sometimes following: e.g. תורות Lev 26:46 ; תורה מצוה, 2Kin 17:37 ; or in different order, e.g. ׳ח ומצות ׳מ ותורות Neh 9:13 ; ומ ׳מצות ׳וח 10:30 ; ׳ומ ׳ח ומצות Deut 26:17 . Apart from משׁפטים it is combined with מצות , e.g. ׳מ ׳וח Exod 15:26 (R), Deut 27:10 ; ׳ח ׳ומ 4:40 ; 1Kin 3:14 ; 8:61 ; ׳מ ׳וח ותורה Neh 9:14 ; ׳מ וח ׳ועדות Deut 6:17 ; 1Chr 29:19 ; 2Chr 34:31 ; מ ׳דברי ׳וח Ezra 7:11 ; it is used with verbs: נתן Lev 26:46 3 t.; צוּה Numbers 30:17 9 t.; למּד Deut 4:1 10 t.; שׁמר 26:17 16 t.; עשׂה 6:24 5 t.; לעשׂות שׁמר 11:32 4 t.; בְּ הלך 1Kin 8:61 3 t. — [On usage of חֹק see חֻקָּה near the end]","rootNote":"from 2710 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 16 17","keyReferences":["1Chr 16 17","1Chr 22 13","1Kgs 3 14","1Kgs 8 58","1Kgs 8 61","1Kgs 9 4","1Sam 30 25","2Chr 7 17"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":128,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 16 17","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/חֹ֔ק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 13","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַֽ/חֻקִּ֣ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 3 14","book":"1Kgs","chapter":3,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֻקַּ/י֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 58","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":58,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/חֻקָּי/ו֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 61","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":61,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/חֻקָּ֛י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 9 4","book":"1Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":4,"englis